{"ID":"20230927152026-8auier9","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927152026-8auier9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927152026-8auier9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927152030-nhgkbks\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927152030-085et65\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927152030-085et65\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:25,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:25\u0026#125;","title":"【助勇丹】","type":"doc","updated":"20230927152030"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927152030-nhgkbks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152030-nhgkbks","updated":"20230927152030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"助勇丹处方来源：《石室秘录》卷三。组成：熟地9钱，山茱萸4钱，芍药5钱，当归5钱，当归5钱，茯苓5钱，白芥子1钱，生枣仁1钱，肉桂1钱。"}]},{"ID":"20230927152030-lkdwe95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152030-lkdwe95","updated":"20230927152030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功效：补肾生肝。"}]},{"ID":"20230927152030-085et65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927152030-085et65","updated":"20230927152030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治：少阳胆虚，肝木之衰，肾水不足，胆怯不敢见人；"}]}]}